%% End-to-end trace of one duel transaction through the BFF boundary:
%% WarRoom.razor → resilient typed HttpClient → cookie verification → Minimal API
%% feature handler → Table Storage, then SignalR streaming and the verdict write-back.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Judge
    participant WR as WarRoom.razor
    participant HC as DuelApiClient<br/>(typed HttpClient + CorrelationHandler)
    participant BFF as BFF boundary<br/>(cookie auth middleware)
    participant EP as DuelsEndpoints<br/>(Minimal API)
    participant H as CommenceDuelHandler
    participant Q as BackgroundTaskQueue<br/>DuelExecutionService
    participant TS as Azure Table Storage
    participant HUB as DuelHub /hubs/duel
    participant AIF as Foundry / Ollama proxy

    Judge->>WR: pick models + prompt, tap Duel
    WR->>HC: CommenceDuelAsync(left, right, prompt)
    Note over HC: stamps X-Session-ID + X-Correlation-ID.<br/>Browser attaches PoLocalCompare.Session cookie
    HC->>BFF: POST /api/duels
    BFF->>BFF: validate HttpOnly cookie<br/>FallbackPolicy RequireAuthenticatedUser
    alt cookie missing / expired
        BFF-->>HC: 401 JSON (never 302)
        HC-->>WR: auth state re-probed → Login view
    else authenticated
        BFF->>EP: authorized request
        EP->>H: CommenceDuelCommand
        H->>TS: read Models (PK 'model'), insert Duel (PK YYYYMM, RK ULID)
        TS-->>H: 201 entity + ETag
        H-->>EP: DuelDto
        EP->>Q: EnqueueAsync(duelId)
        EP-->>HC: 202 Accepted + Location /api/duels/{id}
        HC-->>WR: navigate /processing/{id}
    end

    WR->>HUB: SignalRDuelClient connects, JoinDuel(duelId)
    par left + right race (900s watchdog)
        Q->>AIF: stream inference (retry-only pipeline, SSE-safe)
        AIF-->>HUB: token chunks
        HUB-->>WR: ModelStatusUpdate (velocity, tokens, preview)
        Note over WR: Local (WebLLM) models run in-browser.<br/>Client POSTs /api/duels/{id}/local-result instead
    end
    Q->>TS: save DuelResult per model (PK duelId, RK modelId)
    Q->>TS: update Duel.CompletedAt (If-Match ETag,<br/>412 → re-read + reapply)
    Q->>HUB: DuelComplete(DuelDto)
    HUB-->>WR: navigate /arena/{id}

    Judge->>HC: verdict (or Auto-Judge on timeout)
    HC->>BFF: POST /api/duels/{id}/verdict
    BFF->>EP: authorized
    EP->>TS: RecordVerdictHandler — Elo K=32 writes:<br/>Duel verdict, Models stats, EloHistory ledger
    Note over EP,TS: 412 concurrency race → handler retried once
    EP-->>HC: 200 VerdictResponse (leaderboard cache tag invalidated)
    HC-->>Judge: Elo shift shown
